# Implementation Plan - Phase 11: Flashcard Learning Module

This plan details the design and implementation of Phase 11 of the Leitner Learning Platform, establishing the flashcard learning interface, progress reset triggers, favorites storage, user-submitted flashcard typo reports, and the first-run guided tutorials.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The PDF requirements specify that standard study navigation (using next/prev arrows) must restrict access to Box 2–5 cards that are not yet due today.
> * Standard study loops will ONLY show Box 1 cards + Box 2–5 due cards.
> * Tapping a card number directly triggers a Jump dialog, which allows jumping to *any* card. However, if the target card is in Box 2-5, a warning dialog will prompt the user to confirm that viewing the card directly will reset its Leitner progress to Box 1.

> [!NOTE]
> For audio playing functionality on mobile devices, we will introduce the `audioplayers` package dependency in `pubspec.yaml`.

