- Run backend tests: `dotnet test backend/LeitnerPlatform.Tests/LeitnerPlatform.Tests.csproj`
- Run Flutter analyzer: `flutter analyze` (inside `mobile-app` directory)
- Execute unit tests on repositories and bloc.

### Manual Verification
- Deploy backend and use Postman/cURL to verify report submission works and requires authorization.
- Verify the mobile client UI layout, the flip animation, and local asset rendering.
- Verify that box progression timings, resets, and confirmation dialogs work correctly.
